          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP395 Niton Junction

Posted: N53° 36.410 W115° 52.999

My GPSr: N53° 36.411 W115° 53.001&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(FOUND) GeoGuider and I headed west to see if we log as 'Found' a few brass caps (hoping the loophole for using GSAK was still open). Unfortunately the loophole is closed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thankfully the traffic was very light so we could walk back across the bridge from parking on the west end - no place to park on the east end. Cap in good condition; thanks for the cap OFTH. Pictures to follow.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
